OL,5,G0000 Plastic Surgery Knifemares
OL,6,     FThis episode looks at the
OL,7,     Fdangerous obsession with surgery
OL,8,     Fthat often goes hand in hand with
OL,9,     Fa rise to fame.
OL,10,G0100 Fatal First Dates
OL,11,     FGripping true crime documentary
OL,12,     Fseries. A Canadian girl travels to
OL,13,     FEngland to finally be with a boy
OL,14,     Fthat she thought she was in love
OL,15,     Fwith. But his violence leads to a
OL,16,     Ftragic attack.
OL,17,G0200 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,18,     FPolice respond to what seems to be
OL,19,     Fa hit-and-run leaving three men
OL,20,     Fcritically wounded, but while
OL,21,     Fteams begin to gather evidence one
OL,22,     Fdies in hospital.
