OL,5,G0245 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FMandy, 64, has bled heavily from
OL,7,     Fher nose for over three hours,
OL,8,     Flosing a pint of blood just in the
OL,9,     Fambulance. And Gillian, 76, is
OL,10,     Fbrought in after a fall, covered
OL,11,     Fin blood.
OL,12,G0335 Home and Away
OL,13,     FJustin prepares to face the music.
OL,14,     FCash searches for hope. Richie
OL,15,     Fwants to give back.
